WEBVTT

00:15:25.516 --> 00:15:31.956
Moramo, moramo više pažnje posvetiti
snazi i važnosti emocija

00:15:31.996 --> 00:15:33.756
kada brinemo o našim srcima.

00:15:34.436 --> 00:15:36.796
Emocionalni stres, naučio sam,

00:15:36.796 --> 00:15:39.676
često je pitanje života i smrti.

00:15:41.036 --> 00:15:42.196
Hvala.

00:15:42.236 --> 00:15:47.556
(Pljesak)